      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260724/202607242318218247.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260724/202607242318218247_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260724/202607242318218247_720.jpg"> </div><p>【皮尔洛执教意大利】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-24/6a638b948da6anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">Here we go！罗马诺：皮尔洛执教意大利国家队，签约至2030年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260725/202607250001033348_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260725/202607250001033348_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260725/202607250001033348_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺以标志性的“Here We Go”确认，皮尔洛执教意大利国家队，签约至2030年。</p><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-25/match1964748date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">热身首胜！曼联5-0罗森博格 齐尔克泽传射莱西德瓦尼阿玛斯破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.66" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260725/zhanbao_image_1964748_1784914980_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.66" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.66" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260725/zhanbao_image_1964748_1784914980_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260725/zhanbao_image_1964748_1784914980_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>曼联以5-0大胜罗森博格，取得季前赛首胜，本场莱西、齐尔克泽、德瓦尼、阿玛斯和伊桑·威廉姆斯都取得进球。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-25/6a63af77dc183native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">皇马热身赛1-0阿尔科孔 亚涅斯点射马斯坦图诺造点居莱尔失点</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260725/6a63b1dfe5efd_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260725/6a63b1dfe5efd_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260725/6a63b1dfe5efd_720.jpg"> </div><p>皇马季前备战，球队和阿尔科孔举行了一场闭门热身赛。本场比赛，皇马凭借尾声阶段的一粒点球进球取得了胜利。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-25/match2113054date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">热身赛首胜！巴萨4-1轻取CF欧罗巴 4名青训小将破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260725/202607250447593001.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260725/202607250447593001.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260725/202607250447593001.jpg"> </div><p>巴萨与CF欧罗巴展开闭门热身赛，最终巴萨4-1取胜，多名青训小将破门。</p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-25/6a63b2e15cdf0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">DO：皇马正在运作签下罗德里，对交易抱有信心且目标今夏拿下</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d55509ad8c_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d55509ad8c.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260720/6a5d55509ad8c.jpg"> </div><p>The Athletic名记David Ornstein消息，皇马正在运作签下罗德里的交易。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-25/6a63b52e32130native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：罗德里明确表示希望去皇马，曼城盼留人但预计球员不会续约</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260715/6a56add739bd2_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260715/6a56add739bd2.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260715/6a56add739bd2.jpg"> </div><p>在The Athletic报道皇马开始推进罗德里交易后，记者Ben Jacobs跟进报道了情况，球员方面有充足的转会意愿。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-25/6a638305077eanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">豪购！官方：新月从西汉姆签下荷兰国脚萨默维尔，总价6500万镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.33" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260725/202607250310052548_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.33" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.33" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260725/202607250310052548_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260725/202607250310052548_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，利雅得新月从西汉姆签下荷兰国脚萨默维尔。罗马诺报道称，该交易总价最高可达6500万英镑。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-25/6a63e47816744native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">每体：曼城有意巴萨中场贝尔纳尔，将其视为罗德里的接班人</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.37" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260223/699b501d10d81.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.37" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.37" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260223/699b501d10d81.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260223/699b501d10d81.jpg"> </div><p>《每日体育报》报道，曼城有意巴萨年轻中场贝尔纳尔，已经试探完成这笔交易的可能性。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-25/6a63c0dd04b2enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">莱奥：我已和米兰谈过离队可能性，会分析各种选择但我尊重米兰</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.54" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260103/6958400290b54.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.54" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.54" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260103/6958400290b54.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260103/6958400290b54.jpg"> </div><p>葡媒O jogo消息，米兰前锋莱奥在一档播客节目中表示，他已经向米兰表达离队意愿。此前采访中，莱奥已经表达过转会想法，如今他重申了这一决定。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-24/6a638412eb24anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">隆戈：费内巴切能为莱奥承担4000万欧＋奖金，米兰坚持要价6000万</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260301/69a43953ec0a9.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260301/69a43953ec0a9.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260301/69a43953ec0a9.jpg"> </div><p>米兰跟队记者隆戈发布的最新视频中，谈到了莱奥的转会进展。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-25/6a63b8f52f161native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进球网：利雅得胜利在评估签下B费，C罗正在努力推动实现交易</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3b33fcb045a.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3b33fcb045a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260624/6a3b33fcb045a.jpg"> </div><p>进球网报道，利雅得胜利在今夏在管理层方面有所变动，同时他们也已经有一个明确的转会目标，那就是C罗的前队友B费。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-25/6a63dab1025f1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：国米接触热刺开始谈罗梅罗转会，国米愿意出4000万欧元</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.47" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260118/696c00adf159a.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.47" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.47" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260118/696c00adf159a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260118/696c00adf159a.jpg"> </div><p>记者Gianluigi Longari报道，国米就克里斯蒂安·罗梅罗的转会接触热刺，国米愿意出4000万欧元。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-25/6a63d8f449956native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：赫尔城免签31岁日本中场守田英正，签约2+1年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260725/202607250529464916.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260725/202607250529464916.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260725/202607250529464916.jpg"> </div><p>英超升班马赫尔城官方消息，球队签下日本中场守田英正，双方签约2+1年。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-25/6a63d5d909e3dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：皇马本周已1亿欧报价迪奥曼德但被拒！莱比锡要价更高</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260615/6a2f3ef8a4a03.jpg" data-thu